testing: Flatten nested arrays
元の形: arrays/flatten の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import flatten from dw::core::Arrays
output application/json
---
flatten([[1, 2], [3, 4], [5, 6]])
